    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody powerful Immortals to lead armies and dominate the battlefield in this immersive RTS. Experience easy-to-learn, hard-to-master gameplay in both engaging PvE and competitive PvP battles. Choose from a variety of characters and factions to find your playstyle and conquer your rivals! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/ebddff7e636db2a3cd8fec7a31eecd11.poster.avif?t=1749088945\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/ebddff7e636db2a3cd8fec7a31eecd11.webm?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/4efa778b2a05d28b352b3171b8b6986a.avif?t=1749088945\" width=615 height=81 /></span>As an Immortal, you bring unique warriors to your faction\u2019s war-effort, augmenting and shaping your strategies. Wield Pyre to unleash devastating powers and outgun or outmaneuver your opponents in intense PVP or challenging PVE missions. Whether you enjoy casual team-matches or fierce competitive battles, IMMORTAL has a home for you and your friends. With an optional Build Assist function and a host of accessibility features, building and commanding an army has never been easier, allowing you to sharpen your skills and customize your strategy to suit your style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/6e1293f82d899b1ebedcd292f8d647e6.poster.avif?t=1749088945\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/6e1293f82d899b1ebedcd292f8d647e6.webm?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/6e1293f82d899b1ebedcd292f8d647e6.mp4?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/3b431a3037c3b139371f6a5285f113ee.avif?t=1749088945\" width=615 height=81 /></span>The Gates of Pyre have lain dormant for eons, closed by a forgotten apocalypse. Now, these ancient Ways roar to life. In their shadows, new nations have risen to lay claim to these Elder Legacies and the immeasurable power they hold. You are an Immortal, a godlike leader at the helm of a proud nation. Through conquest and cunning, you will lead your people to glorious victory or ignoble defeat. Choose wisely, each faction and Immortal is unique in their abilities and array of warriors. Break the skies with the Angelic Empire or command the beasts of the Deep Way with the Root Witches. The destiny of these worlds is yet unwritten, Immortal. Go forth, and write your saga on the battlefield!  <br>  \t </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/1a959b2d06e9e0941b0110819c6f32c3.poster.avif?t=1749088945\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/1a959b2d06e9e0941b0110819c6f32c3.webm?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/1a959b2d06e9e0941b0110819c6f32c3.mp4?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/a8278c66dadda9299b23e92e6d0903c1.webp?t=1749088945\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE &amp; PvP RTS gameplay: Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Immortal selection: Tailor your gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Vanguard units: Command powerful forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signature powers: Unleash devastating abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: Casual and competitive options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Assist functionality: Focus on strategy without micromanagement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic lore: Explore the rich history of the Gates of Pyre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization: Personalize your strategy. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody powerful Immortals to lead armies and dominate the battlefield in this immersive RTS. Experience easy-to-learn, hard-to-master gameplay in both engaging PvE and competitive PvP battles. Choose from a variety of characters and factions to find your playstyle and conquer your rivals! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/ebddff7e636db2a3cd8fec7a31eecd11.poster.avif?t=1749088945\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/ebddff7e636db2a3cd8fec7a31eecd11.webm?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/4efa778b2a05d28b352b3171b8b6986a.avif?t=1749088945\" width=615 height=81 /></span>As an Immortal, you bring unique warriors to your faction\u2019s war-effort, augmenting and shaping your strategies. Wield Pyre to unleash devastating powers and outgun or outmaneuver your opponents in intense PVP or challenging PVE missions. Whether you enjoy casual team-matches or fierce competitive battles, IMMORTAL has a home for you and your friends. With an optional Build Assist function and a host of accessibility features, building and commanding an army has never been easier, allowing you to sharpen your skills and customize your strategy to suit your style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/6e1293f82d899b1ebedcd292f8d647e6.poster.avif?t=1749088945\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/6e1293f82d899b1ebedcd292f8d647e6.webm?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/6e1293f82d899b1ebedcd292f8d647e6.mp4?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/3b431a3037c3b139371f6a5285f113ee.avif?t=1749088945\" width=615 height=81 /></span>The Gates of Pyre have lain dormant for eons, closed by a forgotten apocalypse. Now, these ancient Ways roar to life. In their shadows, new nations have risen to lay claim to these Elder Legacies and the immeasurable power they hold. You are an Immortal, a godlike leader at the helm of a proud nation. Through conquest and cunning, you will lead your people to glorious victory or ignoble defeat. Choose wisely, each faction and Immortal is unique in their abilities and array of warriors. Break the skies with the Angelic Empire or command the beasts of the Deep Way with the Root Witches. The destiny of these worlds is yet unwritten, Immortal. Go forth, and write your saga on the battlefield!  <br>  \t </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/1a959b2d06e9e0941b0110819c6f32c3.poster.avif?t=1749088945\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/1a959b2d06e9e0941b0110819c6f32c3.webm?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/1a959b2d06e9e0941b0110819c6f32c3.mp4?t=1749088945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921580/extras/a8278c66dadda9299b23e92e6d0903c1.webp?t=1749088945\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE &amp; PvP RTS gameplay: Easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Immortal selection: Tailor your gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Vanguard units: Command powerful forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signature powers: Unleash devastating abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: Casual and competitive options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Assist functionality: Focus on strategy without micromanagement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic lore: Explore the rich history of the Gates of Pyre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization: Personalize your strategy. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "IMMORTAL: Gates of Pyre is an immersive RTS where you play as powerful Immortals to lead armies and dominate the battlefield. Experience easy-to-learn, hard-to-master gameplay in both engaging PvE and competitive PvP battles. Choose your Immortal, forge your strategy, and crush your foes.",
